The Home feed optimistically toggles liked state without properly reconciling the result of `addReactionToPost()`.

The inspected API does not establish a complete unlike operation.

Repair this according to the approved canonical reaction contract.

### E. My Network filtering defect

The examined code returns every post when the relationship-ID set is empty.

This can expose unrelated posts under My Network.

Correct this without confusing D03 follows with D17 Confirmed Vibes.

### F. Local Vibes filtering defect

